# The order desk from the tutorial at https://bever.dev/guide/tutorial.

Identity
    Registration Enabled

Entity Customer
    Field Name Text(200)
    Field Email Email
    Field Phone Phone?
    Field Tier Enum(Standard, Gold) = Standard

Entity Product
    Field Name Text(120)
    Field Price Money
    Field Active Boolean = True

Entity Order
    Field Number Text(20)
    Field Customer -> Customer
    Field Product -> Product
    Field Quantity Int = 1
    Field Status Enum(Open, Shipped, Cancelled) = Open
    Field OrderedOn Date
    Field SalesRep -> Identity

    Present
        RecordLabel Number
        Field OrderedOn
            Label "Order date"

        Listing
            Fields Number, Customer, Status, OrderedOn, SalesRep

        Editing
            Mode Modal

        Creating
            Mode Page
            Fields Number, Customer, Product, Quantity, OrderedOn, SalesRep
            Input Product
                Picker Dropdown

Action Crud Customer
    By Authenticated
    OrderBy Name

Action Crud Product
    By Authenticated

Action Create, Read Order
    By Authenticated

Action Update, Delete Order
    By SalesRep
